" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"536\">Belangrijkste kenmerken:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"587\">📱 <strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"552\">Opslag</strong>: 32GB – uitbreidbaar met microSD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"659\">🧠 <strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"605\">Geheugen</strong>: 2GB RAM – geschikt voor educatieve apps en video’s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"745\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"745\">👨‍👩‍👧 <strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"701\">Kindvriendelijke interface</strong>: Met ouderlijk toezicht en contentfilters</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"807\">🧳 <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"766\">Meegeleverd</strong>: Originele doos + stevige beschermhoes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"831\">🖤 <strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"822\">Kleur</strong>: Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"863\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"850\">Garantie</strong>: Inclusief</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"877\">Staat:</h3>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"506\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"977\"><strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"977\">Gebruikt, maar in degelijke en goed werkende staat – inclusief garantie voor extra gemoedsrust.</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"thread-bottom-container\" class=\"isolate z-3 w-full basis-auto has-data-has-thread-er